  "details": "FLTK (pronounced \"fulltick\") is a cross-platform C++ GUI toolkit. It provides modern GUI functionality without the bloat, and supports 3D graphics via OpenGL and its built-in GLUT emulation.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * fltk: fltk: Arbitrary code execution via crafted BMP image file (CVE-2026-116723)\n  * fltk: fltk: Arbitrary code execution via integer overflow in BMP image parsing (CVE-2026-116724)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
